<view class="page">
  <view class="section-title">选择评价</view>
  <view class="rating-row">
    <button class="{{rating === 'good' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-rating="good" bindtap="selectRating">好评</button>
    <button class="{{rating === 'normal' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-rating="normal" bindtap="selectRating">中评</button>
    <button class="{{rating === 'bad' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-rating="bad" bindtap="selectRating">差评</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card score-card">
    <view>完成互助的信用分奖励已在确认完成时发放（+5）。</view>
    <view class="muted">评价仅记录口碑，不额外调整信用分。</view>
  </view>

  <textarea placeholder="写下评价内容" bindinput="updateContent" value="{{content}}"></textarea>
  <button class="primary-button" bindtap="submitReview" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}">提交评价</button>
</view>
